# Final Project Topic Selection

## Overview
This assignment focused on selecting a topic for the final machine learning project.

## Topic
AI DJ: Music Recommendation System Based on User Vibe.

## Problem Area
Music recommendation and personalized media experiences.

## What I Planned to Build
The goal was to build a machine learning model that predicts whether a user would like a song based on song features such as energy, danceability, valence, and tempo.

## Reflection
I chose this topic because music recommendation systems are used every day by platforms like Spotify, Apple Music, and YouTube Music.
